        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14739\">PR #14739</a> from <code>alexcrichton:clear-may-leave</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Clear the <code>may_leave</code> flag is some locations where it was required and<br>\nmissing. Namely when lowering results from a <code>stream</code> or <code>future</code> read,<br>\nor returning the string from <code>error-context.debug-message</code>.</p>\n<p>This is done by moving the logic to clear the flag to within<br>\n<code>LowerContext::realloc</code> so that new builtins which result in lowerings<br>\ndon't won't need to handle it.</p>\n<p>part of <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-7v24-42x9-pxf7\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-7v24-42x9-pxf7</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
